---
description: >-
  A single `decision`-shaped node with three labeled outgoing branches
  (bug/feature/question), each routing to a different downstream node.
---
agentflow-beta TB
  triage["Triage"]@{ shape: decision }
  triage -- bug --> bugfix["Bug Fix"]
  triage -- feature --> feature_work["Feature Work"]
  triage -- question --> answer["Answer"]
